{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2023-01-20 10:57:00', 'title': 'NRG ENERGY, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NRG ENERGY, INC. (NYSE:NRG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK OF $0.3775 PER SHARE, OR $1.51 PER SHARE ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS. THIS DIVIDEND REPRESENTS AN 8% INCREASE FROM THE PRIOR YEAR, IN LINE WITH THE COMPANY'S PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ANNUAL DIVIDEND GROWTH RATE TARGET OF 7-9% PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 15, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF FEBRUARY 1, 2023."}